<h2 id="comments">Comments</h2>
<p>Comments are nested under tasks. Each comment belongs to a task and is ordered by creation date (ascending).</p>

<h3>Endpoints</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th><th>Permission</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/tasks/:task_id/comments.json</code></td><td>List comments for a task</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/tasks/:task_id/comments.json</code></td><td>Create a comment</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/tasks/:task_id/comments/:id.json</code></td><td>Delete a comment</td><td>Admin</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Request parameters (create)</h3>
<p>Wrap parameters in a <code>comment</code> key:</p>
<pre><code>{
  "comment": {
    "author_name": "string",
    "text":        "string (required)"
  }
}</code></pre>

<h3>Response example (single comment)</h3>
<pre><code>{
  "id": 1,
  "task_id": 1,
  "author_name": "pirat42",
  "text": "Flyer sind bestellt.",
  "created_at": "2025-05-04T12:30:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-04T12:30:00.000Z",
  "url": "https://meine-piraten.de/tasks/1/comments/1.json"
}</code></pre>

