<h2 id="messages">Messages</h2>
<p>Private messages between users of this server. Request bodies are top-level JSON (no wrapper key). Send <code>Accept: application/json</code> or append <code>.json</code>.</p>

<h3>Endpoints</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th><th>Permission</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/messages.json</code></td><td>Your 50 most recent received messages, newest first</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/api/messages.json</code></td><td>Send a message</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
    <tr><td>PATCH/PUT</td><td><code>/api/messages/:id.json</code></td><td>Mark a received message as read</td><td>Recipient only</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Response example (list)</h3>
<pre><code>[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "sender_id": 42,
    "body": "Kannst du die Flyer bis Freitag fertig haben?",
    "read": false,
    "created_at": "2026-03-19T10:30:00Z"
  }
]</code></pre>

<h3>Send a message</h3>
<pre><code>POST /api/messages.json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipient_id": 42, "body": "Ja, kein Problem!" }</code></pre>
<p>Returns <code>201 Created</code> with <code>{ "id": 2 }</code>. A blank <code>body</code> or unknown <code>recipient_id</code> returns <code>422</code> with <code>{ "errors": [...] }</code>.</p>

<h3>Mark as read</h3>
<p><code>PATCH /api/messages/:id.json</code> returns <code>200 OK</code> with <code>{}</code>. A message that does not exist or was not sent to you returns <code>404</code> with <code>{ "error": "Not found" }</code>.</p>

<hr>

<h2 id="push-subscriptions">Push Subscriptions</h2>
<p>Register APNs device tokens for server-sent push notifications. Request bodies are top-level JSON.</p>

<h3>Endpoints</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th><th>Permission</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/api/push_subscriptions.json</code></td><td>Register a token or update its preferences (upsert by token)</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/api/push_subscriptions/:token.json</code></td><td>Remove a token (idempotent, always <code>200</code>)</td><td>Any authenticated user</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Register / update</h3>
<pre><code>POST /api/push_subscriptions.json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "a1b2c3d4e5f6...",
  "platform": "ios",
  "messages": true,
  "todos": false,
  "forum": false,
  "news": true
}</code></pre>
<p><code>platform</code> defaults to <code>"ios"</code>. Each category is enabled only if sent as the JSON boolean <code>true</code>; missing values or the string <code>"true"</code> disable it. Every call overwrites all four preferences and assigns the token to the calling user. Returns <code>200 OK</code> with <code>{}</code>, or <code>422</code> with <code>{ "errors": [...] }</code>.</p>

<h3>Notification payloads</h3>
<p>Payloads contain no personal data: alert title is always <code>"PIRATEN App"</code>, the body a fixed German text. <code>badge</code> is the recipient's number of unread messages.</p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Trigger</th><th>Category</th><th>Alert body</th><th>Extra keys</th><th>Recipients</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>New message</td><td><code>messages</code></td><td>Du hast eine neue Nachricht</td><td><code>deepLink: "message"</code>, <code>topicId</code> (message id)</td><td>The recipient</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Task created, or its status / assignee changed</td><td><code>todos</code></td><td>Ein ToDo wurde aktualisiert</td><td><code>deepLink: "todo"</code>, <code>todoId</code></td><td>The assignee, or all <code>todos</code> subscribers if the task has no assignee</td></tr>
    <tr><td>New Telegram news post</td><td><code>news</code></td><td>Es gibt neue Neuigkeiten</td><td><code>deepLink: "forum"</code></td><td>All <code>news</code> subscribers</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>The <code>forum</code> category can be stored but nothing on the server sends forum notifications.</p>
